{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Let Dan be a serpent.</b> It is of the species of the evil serpent par excellence — the one called צפעוני, and among Arab physicians called חורמן. For indeed a single צפעוני can kill many people at once through its gaze and the sound it sends forth against a person. So too Samson alone killed many in a brief moment." "<b>A שפיפון.</b> It is a thin serpent, as the Sages said: 'כחוט השערה הוא ושפיפון שמו' — 'it is like a hair's thread, and its name is שפיפון.' And the physicians reported of it that it hides in trees to shoot itself like an arrow at other living creatures. So too Samson, when fighting alone, was invisible amid the host of his slain."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:35:23.575395885Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}